  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n29 ∶ 111 ∶∶ 72 ∶ ? ∶∶ 36 ∶ 139\n\n**Logic: **Second no. = [(First no. × 4) - 5]\n\n**29 : 111 →**\n\n⇒ [(29 × 4) - 5]\n\n⇒ (116 - 5) = 111\n\n**36 : 139 →**\n\n⇒ [(36 × 4) - 5]\n\n⇒ (144 - 5) = 139\n\nSimilarly, for '72 : ?' →\n\n⇒ [(72 × 4) - 5]\n\n⇒ (288 - 5) = **283**\n\nHere, **'72 : 283' **is the correct pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".\n\n3b:T70a,\n<",
